        <defName>FCP_Backstory_MarkedMan_Deserter</defName>
        <identifier>FCP_Backstory_MarkedMan_Deserter</identifier>
        <slot>Adulthood</slot>
        <title>Marked Deserter</title>
        <titleShort>Marked Deserter</titleShort>
        <description>[PAWN_nameDef] slipped away from their unit before the Divide split open, hoping to disappear into the wasteland instead of into the ground. The storms found them anyway. Desertion, it turns out, was never far enough.</description>
        <skillGains>
            <Shooting>4</Shooting>
            <Melee>4</Melee>
