        <identifier>FCP_Backstory_MarkedMan_HeavyGunner</identifier>
        <slot>Adulthood</slot>
        <title>Marked Heavy Gunner</title>
        <titleShort>Marked Heavy Gunner</titleShort>
        <description>Once part of an NCR heavy weapons detachment sent to hold the supply route at any cost, [PAWN_nameDef] never learned any cost was too high until the sky came down. What's left still carries the weight like it means something.</description>
        <skillGains>
