        <identifier>FCP_Backstory_MarkedMan_Demolitions</identifier>
        <slot>Adulthood</slot>
        <title>Marked Demolitions</title>
        <titleShort>Marked Demolitions</titleShort>
        <description>An NCR combat engineer who rigged the silo blast doors that were never supposed to open. [PAWN_nameDef] doesn't remember giving the order that fired the missiles, only the light afterward, and the years of storm since.</description>
        <skillGains>
