        <identifier>FCP_Backstory_MarkedMan_Smuggler</identifier>
        <slot>Adulthood</slot>
        <title>Marked Smuggler</title>
        <titleShort>Marked Smuggler</titleShort>
        <description>[PAWN_nameDef] worked the Divide's supply route from the shadows, moving contraband past both armies for a cut of the profit. The profit's gone, the armies are gone, and all that's left is the shadow.</description>
        <skillGains>
